# The image badge in the composer's edits: a typed `[Image #1]` beside a
# badge that is #1 (the badge is sent under a fresh number), a badge killed
# with Ctrl-U and yanked back twice (each yank a fresh image), a history
# recall that brings the image back, and a paste one byte past the prompt's
# 8 MiB budget, then a prompt that goes through after it.
models models-image.json
gateway image-composer-turns.json
work image-ws
wait 5
paste shot.png
wait 1.5
type  duplicate [Image #1]
wait 0.5
snap lookalike
key Enter
wait 4
snap lookalike-sent
paste shot.png
wait 1.5
key C-u
key C-y
key C-y
wait 1
snap yanked
key Enter
wait 4
snap yanked-sent
key Up
wait 1
snap recalled
key Enter
wait 4
snap recalled-sent
pastex 8388609
wait 8
snap oversized
type RECOVERY
key Enter
wait 4
snap recovered
gwlog
